sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Cliente (Web)
    participant API as API FastAPI
    participant CMD as commands.create_pond
    participant DB as PostgreSQL interno
    participant NA as node-agent
    participant D as Docker

    U->>API: POST /api/v1/ponds {name}
    API->>CMD: create_pond(ctx, inp)
    CMD->>DB: verificar suscripción y cuota
    CMD->>DB: INSERT ponds + pond_status + job create_pond
    CMD-->>API: 202 AcceptedJob
    API-->>U: pond status=provisioning

    NA->>API: POST /internal/v1/jobs/claim
    API-->>NA: payload create_pond
    NA->>D: run postgres:16-alpine (puerto, límites, volumen)
    D-->>NA: healthy (pg_isready)
    NA->>API: jobs/{id}/complete succeeded
    API->>DB: pond_status.observed=running

    U->>API: GET /ponds/{id}/connection
    API-->>U: uri postgresql://…@host:15xxx/app
